    "plain_statement": "On the lattices computed here, arrangements that are stable under the repository Hamiltonian differ gravitationally only through ordinary stress-energy. Opposite windings match in energy, multipoles, and the even pair correlator. The N\u00e9el arrangement is stationary but unstable, and its far field differs from the vacuum by \u0394M = \u0394E/c\u00b2 with vanishing extra multipoles. The one toy coupling can split a same-stress pair, but that pair is not stable, and the coupling is not part of the action. Matched full active mass leaves no residual."
  },
